    <div class="about-text">
      <p class="contact-bio">Yousif Alzayed is an interdisciplinary artist based in Kuwait City. Focusing on Video installations and audio-visual performances. Their work looks deeply at ecology and patterns in nature, often in collaboration with environmental institutions and research laboratories. In his work, Yousif creates custom electronics that he performs with as instruments and embeds within his sculptures. Yousif holds a BFA in Film/Video and an MFA in Art &amp; Technology / Sound Practices from The School of The Art Institute of Chicago.</p>
